  "body": "Looking for a home that ticks all the boxes without breaking the bank?  This could be the one!  Set in a quiet cul-de-sac, this lovely, low-maintenance brick and tile home offers easy living, plenty of space for the whole family and a location that's hard to beat.\r\n\r\nFEATURING:\r\n* Four bedrooms - or use the front bedroom as a home-office.\r\n* Master bedroom with ensuite, plus a family bathroom.\r\n* Open-plan kitchen, dining and family area, flowing effortlessly onto a private patio - perfect for family BBQs and entertaining.\r\n* Separate living area for extra space and relaxation.\r\n* Flat, fully fenced section with plenty of room for children and pets to run, play and enjoy.\r\n* Popular brick and tile construction for easy-care living.\r\n* Healthy Homes certified.\r\n\r\nEnjoy being close to shops, schools, local amenities and a choice of beautiful beaches, while coming home to the peace and quiet of a tucked-away cul-de-sac.  This one is a goodie! The owners are motivated, the decision has been made, and the property is definitely for sale. There is no better time than now!  Don't delay - call today to arrange your viewing. You could even be settled in and enjoying your new home before Christmas!\r\n\r\nEasy living, great location and excellent value - what more could you ask for?\r\nDEADLINE SALE: Closes Wednesday 16 December 2026 (unless sold prior).",
